# and their doc comments. Hosts are placeholders ("h", "host", a reserved
# example domain, a documentation IPv6 range); none is a real service, and all
# of these spans already exist on the public 2omop base. Exact spans only:
# the pattern stops at the first path separator, so a different credential or
# host is still reported. Added to let a clinical PR push past the guardrail's
# dev/main merge-base scan without bypassing it.
